Package: geonuts
Type: Package
Title: Identify and Visualize European NUTS Regions from Geolocations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Attila I.", "Katona", 
             email = "katona.attila@gtk.uni-pannon.hu", 
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Marcell T.", "Kurbucz", 
             email = "m.kurbucz@ucl.ac.uk", 
             role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides functions to identify the corresponding European NUTS 
    (Nomenclature of Territorial Units for Statistics) regions for given 
    geographic coordinates (latitude and longitude), using Eurostat's 
    geospatial boundaries. Includes functionality to visualize the identified 
    regions on a map for validation and exploration. The package is designed 
    for regional data analysis, reproducible workflows, and integration with 
    other geospatial R packages.
